ドールちゃん, I would appreciate it very much!\n\nhttps://nizima.com/Item/DetailItem/101907", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@WAKU2bath/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1579317, "client_id": 3153142, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/638d98cc/uploads/outputs/033e4dc7-6a98-4e7b-98bd-9c758b86809f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=605c842c8c3efd1483689dc8b46bd07d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/638d98cc/uploads/outputs/033e4dc7-6a98-4e7b-98bd-9c758b86809f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=605c842c8c3efd1483689dc8b46bd07d, https://si.imgix.net/638d98cc/uploads/outputs/033e4dc7-6a98-4e7b-98bd-9c758b86809f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eae5ff29051e5036bc7a6bfd95266a40 2x, https://si.imgix.net/638d98cc/uploads/outputs/033e4dc7-6a98-4e7b-98bd-9c758b86809f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0471d401af4923ff0e90d1ff9e7b8657 3x"}, "duration": 2, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/638d98cc/uploads/outputs/033e4dc7-6a98-4e7b-98bd-9c758b86809f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4ea003c938153b9ba2703181dda035f5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/638d98cc/uploads/outputs/033e4dc7-6a98-4e7b-98bd-9c758b86809f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4ea003c938153b9ba2703181dda035f5, https://si.imgix.net/638d98cc/uploads/outputs/033e4dc7-6a98-4e7b-98bd-9c758b86809f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4415ad4d7eef59592b60976fd1afc6f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/638d98cc/uploads/outputs/033e4dc7-6a98-4e7b-98bd-9c758b86809f?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=69943833b1d4e7b1030fbb9ddf98d86c 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nMy name is Nenei Warau (@nn_warau), and I am a private Vtuber.\nI was attracted by your very cute illustrations and motion movies, and I would like to send you a request to draw myself.\n\nDetails of the request\nI would like you to create a movie of the ending screen (16:9) to be used for distribution.\nAs for the pose, we would like you to hold a closed book. The rest of the design composition is up to you.\nWe would also like to include comments on the ending screen, so if possible, we would greatly appreciate it if you could provide a frame for the comments (a simple square or circle would be fine).\nIf this is not possible, please leave it out.\n\nDesign reference\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1GewQQRa-z11sc299x4tOUupYd6ySpgvb/view?usp=drive_link\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@WAKU2bath/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1579317, "client_id": 1902340, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d98473d/uploads/outputs/627b755c-f8c0-4e4a-a985-fecdf98392b5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ab88de3ec6fc941ce2eae61f1b795a3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d98473d/uploads/outputs/627b755c-f8c0-4e4a-a985-fecdf98392b5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ab88de3ec6fc941ce2eae61f1b795a3, https://si.imgix.net/0d98473d/uploads/outputs/627b755c-f8c0-4e4a-a985-fecdf98392b5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e781080c3516c4d581ada7e1f9eddb3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d98473d/uploads/outputs/627b755c-f8c0-4e4a-a985-fecdf98392b5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39ef7d208f3333bdf24f1c9cbf9ec8cc 3x"}, "duration": 2, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0d98473d/uploads/outputs/627b755c-f8c0-4e4a-a985-fecdf98392b5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=05c781c885f6e97dbc3b23f05dfdf3df", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0d98473d/uploads/outputs/627b755c-f8c0-4e4a-a985-fecdf98392b5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=05c781c885f6e97dbc3b23f05dfdf3df, https://si.imgix.net/0d98473d/uploads/outputs/627b755c-f8c0-4e4a-a985-fecdf98392b5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9fb8bb33dfe7d5d80163a521dfb0dfb8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d98473d/uploads/outputs/627b755c-f8c0-4e4a-a985-fecdf98392b5?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b99509891b5b4bccfe5d6d6e429668eb 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nMy name is Minami Mizunazuki, and I am a Vtuber.\n\nI saw your work on Twitter, and I would like to request it...!\n\nRequest details\nOne OPED movie for use in my Vtuber activities, for a total of two movies.\n\nCharacter to be drawn\nVtuber Minami Minazuki\nFor details, please refer to the following URL.\n\nThe composition and costumes are up to you.\nThe original costume can be left as is or arranged.\nWe would like to use it for our activities on Twitter and Youtube, so if possible, we would like to have a composition where the head is not cut off.\nIf you do not have an image, please contact us.\nHolding a game controller\nPlaying a FPS game while yawning\nA sleepy-looking man.\nIf you can't find an image, please use the following images!\n\nUsage\nYoutube distribution, Twitch distribution, promotional activities on Twitter, etc.\n\nWe have no problem rejecting illustrations for VTubers (OC), or for other uses that are out of your genre, or if you do not like the model, etc.\nWe would appreciate your consideration if the conditions match your request.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11dKZv6WOilzkK6q44YHN_fup8mg5q3UG?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@WAKU2bath/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1579317, "client_id": 2677190, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/13cac22d/uploads/outputs/730aadc0-42ff-46b9-8d12-3cddc8327b0b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b034e488c5393157d357cd87edf96fce", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/13cac22d/uploads/outputs/730aadc0-42ff-46b9-8d12-3cddc8327b0b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b034e488c5393157d357cd87edf96fce, https://si.imgix.net/13cac22d/uploads/outputs/730aadc0-42ff-46b9-8d12-3cddc8327b0b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3fd6b2cd1500adb773c4f627f9eced9f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/13cac22d/uploads/outputs/730aadc0-42ff-46b9-8d12-3cddc8327b0b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b90b5ccd2542959b8d437cccc89fa5cf 3x"}, "duration": 6, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/13cac22d/uploads/outputs/730aadc0-42ff-46b9-8d12-3cddc8327b0b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=890713cc3254d161929e2976821c7d55", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/13cac22d/uploads/outputs/730aadc0-42ff-46b9-8d12-3cddc8327b0b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=890713cc3254d161929e2976821c7d55, https://si.imgix.net/13cac22d/uploads/outputs/730aadc0-42ff-46b9-8d12-3cddc8327b0b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=deae6fdadb7fcee14226b41bd4fd524e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/13cac22d/uploads/outputs/730aadc0-42ff-46b9-8d12-3cddc8327b0b?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=20ec846487dbaf174dc6684b4d51993f 3x"}, "body": "thank you for your help\nI have asked you to make a movie that has the same feel as the one I was putting out on X\nThank you very much.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@WAKU2bath/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1579317, "client_id": 1572638, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/041ba5e7/uploads/outputs/8741a8f9-9194-407e-b566-638840a49e2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92255e0ff99d6054d5810a09285179f8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/041ba5e7/uploads/outputs/8741a8f9-9194-407e-b566-638840a49e2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92255e0ff99d6054d5810a09285179f8, https://si.imgix.net/041ba5e7/uploads/outputs/8741a8f9-9194-407e-b566-638840a49e2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d54bdfb185f04c316c73464c91b99f3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/041ba5e7/uploads/outputs/8741a8f9-9194-407e-b566-638840a49e2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb757d71e5bb9ec14f2a6d309755439b 3x"}, "duration": 5, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/041ba5e7/uploads/outputs/8741a8f9-9194-407e-b566-638840a49e2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2b4638dfef9c2914e5b9dcf75f2b13a6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/041ba5e7/uploads/outputs/8741a8f9-9194-407e-b566-638840a49e2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2b4638dfef9c2914e5b9dcf75f2b13a6, https://si.imgix.net/041ba5e7/uploads/outputs/8741a8f9-9194-407e-b566-638840a49e2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ef37cf4aa98baec3c40485f05d39206f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/041ba5e7/uploads/outputs/8741a8f9-9194-407e-b566-638840a49e2c?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5e68092bae14a3b344832fc759f7c933 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you!\nMy name is Satsutaro Kobayashi, a VTuber.\n\nI saw your tweet saying that you could send us a request to create a nice standby screen, and we would love to have you create one for us, so I sent us a request!\n\nThis time, I would like a standby screen with the URL I have pasted 🙏.\nThe design is based on the motif of a Sea Slug.\n\nWe would like you to wear the same clothes as in the attached document, but there are no specifications on the pose.\n\nFinally, I was very happy when I saw your tweet about the request, as I have seen many cute illustrations and avatars and thought they were wonderful.\nThank you very much in advance.\n\nhttps://x.com/satutaro_bayasi/status/1746136380957491397?s=46", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@WAKU2bath/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "video", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1579317, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b568c58b/uploads/outputs/5aacb4a4-3cbd-413f-a2f7-8d665501de0a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56cb1b0520c6c947662c35d093e7b7d4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b568c58b/uploads/outputs/5aacb4a4-3cbd-413f-a2f7-8d665501de0a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=56cb1b0520c6c947662c35d093e7b7d4, https://si.imgix.net/b568c58b/uploads/outputs/5aacb4a4-3cbd-413f-a2f7-8d665501de0a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2abafd5ff78bf12f96fc25b8ffd6a668 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b568c58b/uploads/outputs/5aacb4a4-3cbd-413f-a2f7-8d665501de0a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=67145dacd4d34fd042edb360890382c0 3x"}, "duration": 13, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b568c58b/uploads/outputs/5aacb4a4-3cbd-413f-a2f7-8d665501de0a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c716fce8d90c436073276fa84c8df6cf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b568c58b/uploads/outputs/5aacb4a4-3cbd-413f-a2f7-8d665501de0a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c716fce8d90c436073276fa84c8df6cf, https://si.imgix.net/b568c58b/uploads/outputs/5aacb4a4-3cbd-413f-a2f7-8d665501de0a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2e652f61ec7d3cdf5efb19405583623c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b568c58b/uploads/outputs/5aacb4a4-3cbd-413f-a2f7-8d665501de0a?bg=%23fff&fm=webp&auto=compress&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bc1690e53a7d666d67dacbc9f293f5fb 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you,\nMy name is Tebasaki, and I am the manager of the personal VTuber \"Suzume Chiru\".\n\nI am the manager of a VTuber named \"Suzume Chiru\", and I am the manager of a VTuber named \"Suzume Chiru\".\nI have been wanting to commission Vtuber for a long time, and I was told that only the first few applications were accepted, so there are still some slots available,\nI would be very happy if I could have a chance to work with you.\n\nDetails of the request\nPlease make a movie of the waiting screen for the delivery of Suzume Chiru.\n\nHe is a neutral, slightly bruised and cute sparrow boy.\nHe has feathers that float like a concept, and his hair is gradated with white at the ends.\nHis sparkling eyes, which were also used in Live 2D, are a charm point.\n\nThe costume is up to you. Usually, she wears a uniform-like outfit with mint green lining and soles of shoes, the same color as her tie. Costume arrangements and new outfits are welcome.\n\nFor other details of the character design, we would appreciate it if you could check the URL of the document.\n\nPosing is left up to you.\nWe would be very happy if the posing (composition) is cute and fits the image of Suzumeichiru.\nShe is a Vtuber whose main content is games.\nIf you draw her personal belongings, we would appreciate it if you could scatter controllers, PC devices, etc.\n\n\nMain usage\nTwitter (without Blue registration): Icons, headers, tweets\nYouTube (monetized): waiting screens, membership previews, thumbnails, etc.\n\n\nWe look forward to working with you.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1T5R2UMqyHM1psXtHy33M2sC2ffMdiRtw?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "video", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@WAKU2bath/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4dc32c67/uploads/origins/110a4cca-40bf-4249-8856-fdda8014a324?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=15fdcb43f69ca28370609a22aa870aed", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4dc32c67/uploads/origins/110a4cca-40bf-4249-8856-fdda8014a324?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=15fdcb43f69ca28370609a22aa870aed, https://si.imgix.net/4dc32c67/uploads/origins/110a4cca-40bf-4249-8856-fdda8014a324?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b70b9ff6eea113e3e167a733cb49a3cb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4dc32c67/uploads/origins/110a4cca-40bf-4249-8856-fdda8014a324?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=56e968ccc9561fa256b1abdbe1e31135 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1579317, "client_id": 847165, "nc": 144}, {"path": "/@WAKU2bath/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1579317, "client_id": 2381751, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_