uggestions regarding the composition of the illustration, I would appreciate it if you could give me a little sultry smile. I would be happy if you could give me a figure that is a little sulky (angry?) with a temperature of about I would be very happy if you could give me a figure that looks a little sulky (angry?) with a temperature of about \" `༥ \".\n\nThe main uses are as follows.\n(1) Thumbnails for distribution\n(2) Posting on SNS (tagging, inserting into photos, etc.)\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience, but we would appreciate your consideration.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/hosinomiya_pipi/status/1575924439409078273?t=tPoiiBld0kDDEk0kvvwSgA&s=19", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@WAKU2bath/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1579317, "client_id": 583329, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1be8c4a7/uploads/origins/eabb33d5-f737-4798-9e75-e8918839fefd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5329ec231d5b886709148772eb3e03c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1be8c4a7/uploads/origins/eabb33d5-f737-4798-9e75-e8918839fefd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5329ec231d5b886709148772eb3e03c, https://si.imgix.net/1be8c4a7/uploads/origins/eabb33d5-f737-4798-9e75-e8918839fefd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bf27357791054d434e3a0201d6ceb10 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1be8c4a7/uploads/origins/eabb33d5-f737-4798-9e75-e8918839fefd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e306848c37b2ab3fd4b2c0676a756c80 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1be8c4a7/uploads/origins/eabb33d5-f737-4798-9e75-e8918839fefd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=20